{
  "_description": "Secular excitation spectrum (thesis Ch. 10): a cold Ca40/N2 crystal receives a short dc field pulse (broadband excitation); the FFT of the centre-of-mass motion of each species shows the space-charge shifted secular resonances. The whole-crystal COM mode stays at the single-ion frequency (Kohn theorem) for a single species.",
